    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;6.04</strong> The three-tiered grading system for appendiceal goblet cell adenocarcinoma, based on the proportion of the tumour that consists of low-grade and high-grade patterns</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Misdraji J ",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 446.55pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"595\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"58\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Grade</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"269\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210041212;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Tubular or clustered growth (low-grade pattern)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"269\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210041212;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Loss of tubular or clustered growth (any combination of high-grade patterns)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 43.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"58\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210041212;\"><strong>1</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"269\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><