di-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Other: Present&nbsp;/ absent&nbsp;/ not known</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080369;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Desirable reporting criteria:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 446.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"595\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210080369;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Mismatch repair immunohistochemistry status&nbsp;/ microsatellite instability status</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
